        "subject": "LU-19714 lnet: bind peer_nis when publishing a local net",
        "message": "LU-19714 lnet: bind peer_nis when publishing a local net\n\nA send to a peer on a net that LNet is adding can LBUG:\n\n  ASSERTION( (lp->lpni_txcredits < 0) == !list_empty(&lp->lpni_txq) )\n\nlnet_startup_lndnet() adds the net to ln_nets. lnet_add_net_common()\ncalls lnet_peer_net_added() later. In that window, path selection\ntakes a peer_ni with no lpni_net and 0 tx credits. The message waits\non lpni_txq. lnet_peer_net_added() then resets the credits, and the\nnext send to the peer_ni asserts.\n\nBind the peer_nis in the lnet_net_lock/EX section that adds the net.\nA net add that fails after that point moves the peer_nis back onto\nthe remote peer_ni list. It keeps the peers and routes that existed\nbefore the add.\nNew fail_loc CFS_FAIL_DELAY_NET_ADD delays a net add in test_293.\nNew fail_loc CFS_FAIL_NET_ADD_ERR fails a net add in test_294.\n\nFixes: 973a1060d35e (\"LU-7734 lnet: configure local NI from DLC\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Chris Horn <chorn@ddn.com>\nAssisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5\nChange-Id: Ibbd7169dcb93d219d71d14aeb8a989d93740bbd0\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
